{"text": "aircraft", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">air</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">-craft</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "A vehicle capable of atmospheric flight due to interaction with the air, such as buoyancy or lift\n", "quote": [], "relative": {"Hypernym": ["vehicle"], "Hyponyms": ["airplane", "helicopter"]}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["Received Pronunciation", "/\u02c8\u025b\u0259.k\u0279\u0251\u02d0ft/"], ["General American", "/\u02c8\u025b\u0259\u0279.k\u0279\u00e6ft/"]]}